st/watdahel/modules/students/portal/subject.php?subject=ENG7\" style=\"background:#2563eb;color:#ffffff;text-decoration:none;padding:10px 18px;border-radius:6px;display:inline-block;font-weight:bold;\">Log in to EGradePro to view</a></p><p style=\"font-size:12px;color:#64748b;\">If the button does not work, copy this link: http://localhost/watdahel/modules/students/portal/subject.php?subject=ENG7<br>Sign in with your LRN, then open English 7 &rsaquo; Stream.</p><p style=\"color:#64748b;font-size:12px;\">This is an automatic message from Imelda Integrated Secondary School EGradePro. Please do not reply.</p></div>','Sent',NULL,'2026-09-25 13:05:18','2026-09-25 21:05:23');
