 is a \'Con\' of staying up late to study?\",\"choices\":[\"Better understanding of the material\",\"Improved sleep quality\",\"Fatigue and difficulty concentrating the next day\",\"More hours in the day\"],\"correct_index\":2,\"points\":1}]',10,'gform',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'1S2JL2J_xovX8saZgsjQuhgnLzafD5_pytx5NAuA2MdI','https://docs.google.com/forms/d/1S2JL2J_xovX8saZgsjQuhgnLzafD5_pytx5NAuA2MdI/edit','https://docs.google.com/forms/d/e/1FAIpQLScMIrmGI63sBe4iNiBHKLfLszHWhpVZW5LPhao2PDqk6bENKg/viewform','Sent','2026-09-23 02:44:25','2026-09-23 02:44:47','2026-09-23 02:44:47',NULL),(11,20,'ENG7',NULL,'quiz','English 7: Consonants and Vowels Quiz','cons and prons 10 items','# Quiz: Consonants and Vowels\n\nInstructions: Choose the letter of the best answer for each item.\n\n1. Which of the following is a vowel?\nA. B\nB. S\nC. A\nD. T\n\n2. How many vowels are there in the English alphabet?\nA. 3\nB. 5\nC. 7\nD. 21\n\n3. Which letter is considered a consonant?\nA. E\nB. O\nC. I\nD. M\n\n4. Choose the word that begins with a consonant.\nA. Apple\nB. Elephant\nC. Ball\nD. Ink\n\n5. Choose the word that begins with a vowel.\nA. Cat\nB. Dog\nC. Fish\nD. Owl\n\n6. Which set contains only consonants?\nA. B, C, D\nB. A, E, I\nC. U, O, A\nD. E, B, C\n\n7. Which letter acts as a vowel in the word \'sky\'?\nA. s\nB. k\nC. y\nD. none\n\n8. Which of these is NOT a vowel?\nA. A\nB. U\nC. I\nD. P\n\n9. How many consonants are in the word \'APPLE\'?\nA. 1\nB. 2\nC. 3\nD. 4\n\n10. Identify the vowel in the word \'PEN\'.\nA. P\nB. E\nC. N\nD. none','1. C (A is a vowel)\n2. B (A, E, I, O, U)\n3. D (M is a consonant)\n4. C (Ball begins with B)\n5. D (Owl begins with O)\n6. A (B, C, D are all consonants)\n7. C (Y often functions as a vowel sound)\n8. D (P is a consonant)\n9. C (P, P, L)\n10. B (E is the vowel)','[{\"question\":\"Which of the following is a vowel?\",\"choices\":[\"B\",\"S\",\"A\",\"T\"],\"correct_index\":2,\"points\":1},{\"question\":\"How many vowels are there in the English alphabet?\",\"choices\":[\"3\",\"5\",\"7\",\"21\"],\"correct_index\":1,\"points\":1},{\"question\":\"Which letter is considered a consonant?\",\"choices\":[\"E\",\"O\",\"I\",\"M\"],\"correct_index\":3,\"points\":1},{\"question\":\"Choose the word that begins with a consonant.\",\"choices\":[\"Apple\",\"Elephant\",\"Ball\",\"Ink\"],\"correct_index\":2,\"points\":1},{\"question\":\"Choose the word that begins with a vowel.\",\"choices\":[\"Cat\",\"Dog\",\"Fish\",\"Owl\"],\"correct_index\":3,\"points\":1},{\"question\":\"Which set contains only consonants?\",\"choices\":[\"B, C, D\",\"A, E, I\",\"U, O, A\",\"E, B, C\"],\"correct_index\":0,\"points\":1},{\"question\":\"Which letter acts as a vowel in the word \'sky\'?\",\"choices\":[\"s\",\"k\",\"y\",\"none\"],\"correct_index\":2,\"points\":1},{\"question\":\"Which of these is NOT a vowel?\",\"choices\":[\"A\",\"U\",\"I\",\"P\"],\"correct_index\":3,\"points\":1},{\"question\":\"How many consonants are in the word \'APPLE\'?\",\"choices\":[\"1\",\"2\",\"3\",\"4\"],\"correct_index\":2,\"points\":1},{\"question\":\"Identify the vowel in the word \'PEN\'.\",\"choices\":[\"P\",\"E\",\"N\",\"none\"],\"correct_index\":1,\"points\":1}]',10,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'Draft','2026-09-23 02:58:24','2026-09-23 02:58:24',NULL,NULL),(12,20,'ENG7',11,'quiz','English 7: Consonants and Vowels Quiz','cons and prons 10 items','# Quiz: Consonants and Vowels\n\nInstructions: Choose the letter of the best answer for each item.\n\n1. Which of the following is a vowel?\nA. B\nB. S\nC. A\nD. T\n\n2. How many vowels are there in the English alphabet?\nA. 3\nB. 5\nC. 7\nD. 21\n\n3. Which letter is considered a consonant?\nA. E\nB. O\nC. I\nD. M\n\n4. Choose the word that begins with a consonant.\nA. Apple\nB. Elephant\nC. Ball\nD. Ink\n\n5. Choose the word that begins with a vowel.\nA. Cat\nB. Dog\nC. Fish\nD. Owl\n\n6. Which set contains only consonants?\nA. B, C, D\nB. A, E, I\nC. U, O, A\nD. E, B, C\n\n7. Which letter acts as 