'Our school playground is the most fun\' a fact or an opinion?\nA. Fact\nB. Opinion\n\n8. Which phrase is a common signal for an opinion?\nA. In my opinion\nB. The date is\nC. Research shows\nD. The number is\n\n9. \'Apples contain vitamin C.\' This statement is a:\nA. Fact\nB. Opinion\n\n10. \'Red pencils are prettier than blue ones.\' This statement is a:\nA. Fact\nB. Opinion\n\n11. Which of these is used to support a fact?\nA. Personal judgment\nB. Trusted evidence\nC. A feeling\nD. A preference\n\n12. \'I believe math is easy.\' This sentence is an opinion because:\nA. It uses the words \'I believe\'.\nB. It can be proven by measurement.\nC. It is a recorded event.\nD. It is a date.\n\n13. Which of these can be proven true or false?\nA. Pizza is the best food.\nB. The school bus arrives at 7:15 AM.\nC. Technology is fun.\nD. Math is the most important subject.\n\n14. \'The Philippines has more than 7,000 islands.\' This is a:\nA. Fact\nB. Opinion\n\n15. Which word indicates an opinion?\nA. Worst\nB. Measurement\nC. Name\nD. Place\n\n16. Facts are usually based on:\nA. Personal tastes\nB. Verifiable information\nC. Feelings\nD. Judgments\n\n17. An opinion shares a person\'s:\nA. Measurement\nB. Record\nC. Belief\nD. Date\n\n18. \'Dogs are faster than turtles.\' This can be checked by:\nA. Measuring speed\nB. Asking a friend\nC. Expressing a feeling\nD. Stating a preference\n\n19. Is \'I think science is the most interesting subject\' an opinion?\nA. Yes\nB. No\n\n20. Which is a characteristic of an opinion?\nA. It is always verifiable.\nB. It is personal and subjective.\nC. It is based on research.\nD. It uses dates and numbers.','1. B - The school has 20 classrooms.\n2. C - Math class is boring.\n3. B - It can be proven with evidence.\n4. A - Probably\n5. C - By consulting records or measurements.\n6. A - Fact\n7. B - Opinion\n8. A - In my opinion\n9. A - Fact\n10. B - Opinion\n11. B - Trusted evidence\n12. A - It uses the words \'I believe\'.\n13. B - The school bus arrives at 7:15 AM.\n14. A - Fact\n15. A - Worst\n16. B - Verifiable information\n17. C - Belief\n18. A - Measuring speed\n19. A - Yes\n20. B - It is personal and subjective.','[{\"question\":\"Which of the following is a fact?\",\"choices\":[\"Chocolate is the best flavor.\",\"The school has 20 classrooms.\",\"Science is the most interesting subject.\",\"Blue is the prettiest color.\"],\"correct_index\":1,\"points\":1},{\"question\":\"Which of the following is an opinion?\",\"choices\":[\"Water boils at 100\\u00b0C.\",\"There are 30 students in this class.\",\"Math class is boring.\",\"The library opens at 8:00 AM.\"],\"correct_index\":2,\"points\":1},{\"question\":\"What is a characteristic of a fact?\",\"choices\":[\"It is a personal feeling.\",\"It can be proven with evidence.\",\"It uses signal words like \'best\'.\",\"It is based on a preference.\"],\"correct_index\":1,\"points\":1},{\"question\":\"Which signal word suggests that a statement is an opinion?\",\"choices\":[\"Probably\",\"Number\",\"Date\",\"Record\"],\"correct_index\":0,\"points\":1},{\"question\":\"How do you verify a fact?\",\"choices\":[\"By checking personal feelings.\",\"By asking what others prefer.\",\"By consulting records or measurements.\",\"By trusting a hunch.\"],\"correct_index\":2,\"points\":1},{\"question\":\"Is \'The Earth orbits the Sun\' a fact or an opinion?\",\"choices\":[\"Fact\",\"Opinion\"],\"correct_index\":0,\"points\":1},{\"question\":\"Is \'Our school playground is the most fun\' a fact or an opinion?\",\"choices\":[\"Fact\",\"Opinion\"],\"correct_index\":1,\"points\":1},{\"question\":\"Which phrase is a common signal for an opinion?\",\"choices\":[\"In my opinion\",\"The date is\",\"Research shows\",\"The number is\"],\"correct_index\":0,\"points\":1},{\"question\":\"\'Apples contain vitamin C.\' This statement is a:\",\"choices\":[\"Fact\",\"Opinion\"],\"correct_index\":0,\"points\":1},{\"question\":\"\'Red pencils are prettier than blue ones.\' This statement 