ent that can be checked using records or measurements is called a:\nA. Feeling\nB. Judgment\nC. Fact\nD. Preference\n\n5. An opinion is based on:\nA. Proven evidence\nB. Personal beliefs or feelings\nC. Scientific measurements\nD. Official school records\n\n6. Which sentence is an opinion?\nA. Chocolate ice cream is the best.\nB. The library opens at 8:00 AM.\nC. Apples contain Vitamin C.\nD. Dogs are mammals.\n\n7. To prove a statement is a fact, you should look for:\nA. A personal hunch\nB. Someone\'s strong feeling\nC. Reliable evidence or records\nD. A popular belief\n\n8. Which of these is a factual statement?\nA. Red pencils are the prettiest.\nB. Technology is fun for everyone.\nC. The school has 20 classrooms.\nD. Science is better than English.\n\n9. Which word is a signal for an opinion?\nA. Probably\nB. 2026\nC. Date\nD. Number\n\n10. \"I believe math is easy.\" This sentence is an:\nA. Fact\nB. Opinion\nC. Measurement\nD. Record','1. A - The Philippines has more than 7,000 islands.\n2. C - Math is the most boring subject.\n3. B - I think\n4. C - Fact\n5. B - Personal beliefs or feelings\n6. A - Chocolate ice cream is the best.\n7. C - Reliable evidence or records\n8. C - The school has 20 classrooms.\n9. A - Probably\n10. B - Opinion','[{\"question\":\"Which of these is a fact?\",\"choices\":[\"The Philippines has more than 7,000 islands.\",\"The Philippines is the most beautiful country.\",\"I think the Philippines has great beaches.\",\"Everyone should visit the Philippines.\"],\"correct_index\":0,\"points\":1},{\"question\":\"Which of these is an opinion?\",\"choices\":[\"Water freezes at 0\\u00b0C.\",\"Our school was built in 1998.\",\"Math is the most boring subject.\",\"There are 30 students in the class.\"],\"correct_index\":2,\"points\":1},{\"question\":\"Which phrase is a common signal word for an opinion?\",\"choices\":[\"In 1998\",\"I think\",\"At 8:00 AM\",\"It was measured\"],\"correct_index\":1,\"points\":1},{\"question\":\"A statement that