surements\nC. Hunches\n\n6. \"Our school library opens at 8:00 AM.\" — This sentence is:\nA. Fact\nB. Opinion\nC. Neither\n\n7. \"Science is the most interesting subject.\" — This sentence is:\nA. Fact\nB. Opinion\nC. Both\n\n8. Which word is a common signal word for an opinion?\nA. Beautiful\nB. Recorded\nC. Date\n\n9. \"There are 30 students in this class.\" — This sentence is:\nA. Opinion\nB. Fact\nC. Guess\n\n10. Which is a sign of a fact?\nA. A personal preference\nB. A measurement\nC. A feeling','1. B - Facts can be checked by records.\n2. A - \'I believe\' indicates personal preference.\n3. B - \'I think\' is an opinion signal word.\n4. C - Scientific measurement is a fact.\n5. B - Facts are verified through evidence.\n6. A - Time of opening is verifiable.\n7. B - Interest level is subjective.\n8. A - \'Beautiful\' indicates judgment.\n9. B - Class count can be verified.\n10. B - Measurements are evidence for facts.','[{\"question\":\"The Philippines has more than 7,000 islands. \\u2014 This sentence is:\",\"choices\":[\"Opinion\",\"Fact\",\"Both\"],\"correct_index\":1,\"points\":1},{\"question\":\"I believe math is easy. \\u2014 This sentence is:\",\"choices\":[\"Opinion\",\"Fact\",\"Question\"],\"correct_index\":0,\"points\":1},{\"question\":\"Which is a sign of an opinion?\",\"choices\":[\"A date\",\"I think\",\"A measurement\"],\"correct_index\":1,\"points\":1},{\"question\":\"Water freezes at 0\\u00b0C. \\u2014 This sentence is:\",\"choices\":[\"Opinion\",\"Fiction\",\"Fact\"],\"correct_index\":2,\"points\":1},{\"question\":\"Which would you check to prove a statement is a fact?\",\"choices\":[\"Feelings\",\"Records or measurements\",\"Hunches\"],\"correct_index\":1,\"points\":1},{\"question\":\"Our school library opens at 8:00 AM. \\u2014 This sentence is:\",\"choices\":[\"Fact\",\"Opinion\",\"Neither\"],\"correct_index\":0,\"points\":1},{\"question\":\"Science is the most interesting subject. \\u2014 This sentence is:\",\"choices\":[\"Fact\",\"Opinion\