,'2026-09-24 02:38:14',NULL,NULL),(34,20,'ENG7',NULL,'quiz','quiz1 – fact or opinion','Prepare quiz1 AI – Grade 7-B English 7 from the attached lesson.','# quiz1 – fact or opinion\n\n1. \"The Philippines has more than 7,000 islands.\" — This sentence is:\nA. Opinion\nB. Fact\nC. Both\n\n2. \"I believe math is easy.\" — This sentence is:\nA. Opinion\nB. Fact\nC. Question\n\n3. Which is a signal word for an opinion?\nA. A date\nB. I think\nC. A measurement\n\n4. \"Water freezes at 0°C.\" — This sentence is:\nA. Opinion\nB. Fiction\nC. Fact\n\n5. Which would you check to prove a statement is a fact?\nA. Feelings\nB. Records or measurements\nC. Hunches\n\n6. \"The school library opens at 8:00 AM.\" — This sentence is:\nA. Fact\nB. Opinion\nC. Feeling\n\n7. \"Chocolate milk tastes better than plain milk.\" — This sentence is:\nA. Fact\nB. Opinion\nC. Record\n\n8. Which of these is a characteristic of a fact?\nA. It is based on personal feelings\nB. It can be proven true or false using evidence\nC. It is based on a person\'s preference\n\n9. \"There are 30 students in Grade 7-B.\" — This sentence is:\nA. Opinion\nB. Fact\nC. Judgment\n\n10. Which word is commonly used to express an opinion?\nA. Probably\nB. Number\nC. Date','1. B (Fact - can be verified with records)\n2. A (Opinion - reflects personal belief)\n3. B (I think is a signal word for opinion)\n4. C (Fact - can be measured)\n5. B (Facts are based on records or measurements)\n6. A (Fact - can be checked in records)\n7. B (Opinion - expresses a personal taste)\n8. B (Facts rely on evidence)\n9. B (Fact - can be verified by counting)\n10. A (Probably is an opinion signal word)','[{\"question\":\"\\u201cThe Philippines has more than 7,000 islands.\\u201d \\u2014 This sentence is:\",\"choices\":[\"Opinion\",\"Fact\",\"Both\"],\"correct_index\":1,\"points\":1},{\"question\":\"\\u201cI believe math is easy.\\u201d \\u2014 This sentence is:\",\"choices\":[\"Opinion\",\"Fact\",\"Question\"],\"correct_index\":0,\"points\":1},{\"question\":\"Which is a sign of an opinion?\",\"choices\":[\"A date\",\"I think\",\"A measurement\"],\"correct_index\":1,\"points\":1},{\"question\":\"\\u201cWater freezes at 0\\u00b0C.\\u201d \\u2014 This sentence is:\",\"choices\":[\"Opinion\",\"Fiction\",\"Fact\"],\"correct_index\":2,\"points\":1},{\"question\":\"Which would you check to prove a statement is a fact?\",\"choices\":[\"Feelings\",\"Records or measurements\",\"Hunches\"],\"correct_index\":1,\"points\":1},{\"question\":\"\\u201cThe school library opens at 8:00 AM.\\u201d \\u2014 This sentence is:\",\"choices\":[\"Fact\",\"Opinion\",\"Feeling\"],\"correct_index\":0,\"points\":1},{\"question\":\"\\u201cChocolate milk tastes better than plain milk.\\u201d \\u2014 This sentence is:\",\"choices\":[\"Fact\",\"Opinion\",\"Record\"],\"correct_index\":1,\"points\":1},{\"question\":\"Which of these is a characteristic of a fact?\",\"choices\":[\"It is based on personal feelings\",\"It can be proven true or false using evidence\",\"It is based on a person\'s preference\"],\"correct_index\":1,\"points\":1},{\"question\":\"\\u201cThere are 30 students in Grade 7-B.\\u201d \\u2014 This sentence is:\",\"choices\":[\"Opinion\",\"Fact\",\"Judgment\"],\"correct_index\":1,\"points\":1},{\"question\":\"Which word is commonly used to express an opinion?\",\"choices\":[\"Probably\",\"Number\",\"Date\"],\"correct_index\":0,\"points\":1}]',10,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'Draft','2026-09-24 02:57:23','2026-09-24 02:57:23',NULL,196),(35,20,'ENG7',NULL,'quiz','Jose Rizal: Life and Works Quiz','10 items','# Jose Rizal: Life and Works Quiz\n\nInstructions: Read each question carefully and choose the best answer.\n\n1. What is the full name of Jose Rizal?\nA. Jose Protacio Rizal Mercado y Alonso Realonda\nB. Jose Rizal Mercado y Alonso\nC. Jose Protacio Mercado\nD. Jose Realonda Rizal\n\n2. In what town was Jose Rizal born?\nA. Manila\nB. Calamba\nC. Biñan\nD. Dapitan\n\n3. What was the title of Rizal\'s first novel which exposed the ills of Spanish colonial rule?\nA. El Filibusterismo\nB. Mi Ultimo Adios\nC. Noli Me Tangere\nD. Indios Bravos\n\n4. Which novel served as a sequel to his first work, focusing on political revolution?\nA. El Filibusterismo\nB. Noli Me Tangere\nC. Sa Aking Mga Kabata\nD. To the Young Women of Malolos\n\n5. Who was Rizal\'s mother who taught him his first lessons?\nA. Lucia Rizal\nB. Saturnina Rizal\nC. Teodora Alonso\nD. Maria Rizal\n\n6. Where did Rizal spend his exile years before his execution?\nA. Fort Santiago\nB. Dapitan\nC. Cavite\nD. Bagumbayan\n\n7. What is the title of Rizal\'s famous valedictory poem written before his death?\nA. Sa Aking Mga Kabata\nB. Mi Ultimo Adios\nC. A La Juventud Filipina\nD. Junto al Pasig\n\n8. On what date was Jose Rizal executed at Bagumbayan?\nA. June 19, 1861\nB. December 30, 1896\nC. December 30, 1898\nD. June 19, 1896\n\n9. Rizal was a member of the Propaganda Movement. What was the official newspaper of this movement?\nA. La Solidaridad\nB. Diariong Tagalog\nC. Kalayaan\nD. El Renacimiento\n\n10. Which of Rizal\'s works was a poem written when he was only eight years old?\nA. Mi Ultimo Adios\nB. Sa Aking Mga Kabata\nC. A La Juventud Filipina\nD. Noli Me Tangere','1. A - Jose Protacio Rizal Mercado y Alonso Realonda\n2. B - Calamba\n3. C - Noli Me Tangere\n4. A - El Filibusterismo\n5. C - Teodora Alonso\n6. B - Dapitan\n7. B - Mi Ultimo Adios\n8. B - December 30, 1896\n9. A - La Solidaridad\n10. B - Sa Aking Mga Kabata','[{\"question\":\"What is the full name of Jose Rizal?\",\"choices\":[\"Jose Protacio Rizal Mercado y Alonso Realonda\",\"Jose Rizal Mercado y Alonso\",\"Jose Protacio Mercado\",\"Jose Realonda Rizal\"],\"correct_index\":0,\"points\":1},{\"question\":\"In what town was Jose Rizal born?\",\"choices\":[\"Manila\",\"Calamba\",\"Bi\\u00f1an\",\"Dapitan\"],\"correct_index\":1,\"points\":1},{\"question\":\"What was the title of Rizal\'s first novel which exposed the ills of Spanish colonial rule?\",\"choices\":[\"El Filibusterismo\",\"Mi Ultimo Adios\",\"Noli Me Tangere\",\"Indios Bravos\"],\"correct_index\":2,\"points\":1},{\"question\":\"Which novel served as a sequel to his first work, focusing on political revolution?\",\"choices\":[\"El Filibusterismo\",\"Noli Me Tangere\",\"Sa Aking Mga Kabata\",\"To the Young Women of Malolos\"],\"correct_index\":0,\"points\":1},{\"question\":\"Who was Rizal\'s mother who taught him his first lessons?\",\"choices\":[\"Lucia Rizal\",\"Saturnina Rizal\",\"Teodora Alonso\",\"Maria Rizal\"],\"correct_index\":2,\"points\":1},{\"question\":\"Where did Rizal spend his exile years before his execution?\",\"choices\":[\"Fort Santiago\",\"Dapitan\",\"Cavite\",\"Bagumbayan\"],\"correct_index\":1,\"points\":1},{\"question\":\"What is the title of Rizal\'s famous valedictory poem written before his death?\",\"choices\":[\"Sa Aking Mga Kabata\",\"Mi Ultimo Adios\",\"A La Juventud Filipina\",\"Junto al Pasig\"],\"correct_index\":1,\"points\":1},{\"question\":\"On what date was Jose Rizal executed at Bagumbayan?\",\"choices\":[\"June 19, 1861\",\"December 30, 1896\",\"December 30, 1898\",\"June 19, 1896\"],\"correct_index\":1,\"points\":1},{\"question\":\"Rizal was a member of the Propaganda Movement. What was the official newspaper of this movement?\",\"choices\":[\"La Solidaridad\",\"Diariong Tagalog\",\"Kalayaan\",\"El Renacimiento\"],\"correct_index\":0,\"points\":1},{\"question\":\"Which of Rizal\'s works was a poem written when he was only eight years old?\",\"choices\":[\"Mi Ultimo Adios\",\"Sa Aking Mga Kabata\",\"A La Juventud Filipina\",\"Noli Me Tangere\"],\"correct_index\":1,\"points\":1}]',10,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'Draft','2026-09-25 09:31:47','2026-09-25 09:31:47',NULL,NULL);
